Your body has become a mass of living corruption, increasing your blight and acid resistance by [10%, 15%, 18%, 22%, 25% (TL1-5)] and blight affinity by [7%, 11%, 14%, 17%, 20% (TL1-5)].

On taking damage greater than 15% of your maximum health, the damage will be reduced by [12%, 18%, 22%, 25%, 27% (TL1-5)] and a carrion worm mass will burst forth onto a nearby tile, attacking your foes for 5 turns.

You can never have more than 5 worms active from any source at a time.

When a carrion worm dies it will explode into a radius 2 pool of blight for 5 turns, dealing [41, 55, 66, 75, 83 (TL1-5; SP 100)] blight damage each turn and healing you for 33% of that amount.
